{"seq":1,"slug":"sorting","title":"排序","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/algorithms/sorting","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"basic-sorting","title":"基础排序","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/algorithms/sorting/basic-sorting","wordCount":1478,"readingTime":6},{"seq":2,"slug":"advanced-sorting","title":"高效排序","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/algorithms/sorting/advanced-sorting","wordCount":1937,"readingTime":8},{"seq":3,"slug":"special-sorting","title":"特殊排序","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/algorithms/sorting/special-sorting","wordCount":1984,"readingTime":8}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"排序-简介\">排序 简介</h1><p>排序是算法学习中最经典、最基础的主题之一。将一组无序的数据按照特定规则重新排列，看似简单的需求背后蕴含着丰富的算法设计思想。通过学习排序算法，你将第一次深刻体会到不同算法策略在效率上的巨大差异，并建立起分析时间复杂度与空间复杂度的基本功。</p>\n<p>本章按照算法的复杂度与适用场景，将排序算法划分为三个层次，循序渐进地展开讲解。</p>\n<p><strong>基础排序</strong> 涵盖冒泡排序、选择排序和插入排序。这三种算法的核心思想直观易懂，实现起来也非常简单，是理解排序概念的最佳入口。虽然它们的平均时间复杂度为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，在大规模数据上表现欠佳，但在小规模数据或数据接近有序的场景中依然有其实用价值。更重要的是，它们为后续理解高级排序算法奠定了思维基础。</p>\n<p><strong>高级排序</strong> 引入归并排序、快速排序和堆排序三种高效算法。它们的平均时间复杂度均为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n \\log n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，是工程实践中最常用的排序方案。归并排序体现了分治策略的精髓，快速排序以其优秀的平均性能成为各大语言标准库的首选实现，堆排序则展示了利用数据结构（堆）辅助算法设计的典型范式。理解这三种算法，你将真正感受到算法优化带来的量级提升。</p>\n<p><strong>特殊排序</strong> 介绍计数排序、桶排序和基数排序。与前面基于比较的排序不同，这些算法利用数据本身的特征（如取值范围、位数分布）突破了比较排序 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n \\log n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 的理论下界，在特定条件下可以达到线性时间复杂度。了解它们的适用前提与局限性，能帮助你在面对特殊数据分布时做出更明智的算法选择。</p>\n<p>建议按照基础、高级、特殊的顺序依次学习。每种算法都配有详细的原理说明与 TypeScript 实现代码，动手编写并运行这些代码将帮助你更牢固地掌握排序的核心思想。</p>\n"}